{"verse_key": "14:28", "surah": 14, "verse": 28, "text_uthmani": "۞ أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى ٱلَّذِينَ بَدَّلُوا۟ نِعْمَتَ ٱللَّهِ كُفْرًا وَأَحَلُّوا۟ قَوْمَهُمْ دَارَ ٱلْبَوَارِ", "translation": "Have you not considered those who exchanged the favor of Allāh for disbelief<sup foot_note=196574>1</sup> and settled their people [in] the home of ruin?", "verse_from_ms": 634330, "verse_to_ms": 641200, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "۞", "start_ms": 634330, "end_ms": 636000}, {"i": 1, "text": "أَلَمْ", "start_ms": 636000, "end_ms": 637040}, {"i": 2, "text": "تَرَ", "start_ms": 637040, "end_ms": 637850}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 637850, "end_ms": 639110}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 639110, "end_ms": 640585}, {"i": 5, "text": "بَدَّلُوا۟", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 6, "text": "نِعْمَتَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 8, "text": "كُفْرًا", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَأَحَلُّوا۟", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 10, "text": "قَوْمَهُمْ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 11, "text": "دَارَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلْبَوَارِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}